": "Found some old games and been really enjoying them. Just trying to stay busy, keep my mind off stuff.", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 134}, {"session_id": "p000200-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But I guess I'm glad I have these games to unwind.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 89}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261002T222259Z", "last_updated_at": "20261002T223818Z", "first_seen_session": "p000200-cellD_dec_gated-s2", "last_session": "p000200-cellD_dec_gated-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false}
